# Environment

Copy to `.env` for local development. Never commit real secrets.

```env
# Required only for DB tooling (drizzle-kit push). The portfolio site and the
# health-only API server run without it.
DATABASE_URL=

# Optional local overrides (Replit artifact runtime provides these in prod).
PORT=5173
BASE_PATH=/
LOG_LEVEL=info
NODE_ENV=development
```
